          "end": 1113.64,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " alcohol.",
          "start": 1113.64,
          "end": 1113.94,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The whole country knows the evils of alcohol.",
