    {
      "text": "[66:3] The prophet had trusted some of his wives with a certain statement, then one of them spread it, and GOD let him know about it. He then informed his wife of part of the issue, and disregarded part. She asked him, \"Who informed you of this?\" He said, \"I was informed by the Omniscient, Most Cognizant.\"",
