          "end": 1554.12,
          "speaker": "Lori"
        },
        {
          "word": " because",
          "start": 1554.12,
          "end": 1554.6,
          "speaker": "Lori"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "it wasn't enough that he was a messenger. They wanted to make him a god besides God.",
